          "content": "\n\n### 1. pmc-basic-service模块分析\n```java\n// 典型服务层结构\npmc-basic-service\n├── src/main/java\n│   ├── com/baidu/pmc/service\n│   │   ├── PaymentService.java       // 支付核心逻辑\n│   │   ├── ReconService.java         // 对账服务  \n│   │   └── NotifyService.java        // 通知服务\n│   └── com/baidu/pmc/controller\n│       └── InternalApiController.java // 内部RPC接口\n```\n\n核心功能：\n- 支付流程控制（含事务管理）\n- 银行渠道路由选择\n- 交易状态机管理\n- 定时任务调度\n\n### 2. Feign+REST通信配置\n```yaml\n# application.yml配置示例\nfeign:\n  client:\n    config:\n      default:\n        connectTimeout: 5000\n        readTimeout: 30000\n        loggerLevel: basic\n\n# 银行接口FeignClient定义\n@FeignClient(\n  name = \"bank-gateway\",\n  url = \"${bank.endpoint}\",\n  configuration = BankFeignConfig.class\n)\npublic interface BankClient {\n    @PostMapping(\"/transaction\")\n    BankResponse executePayment(@RequestBody BankRequest request);\n}\n\n// 自定义配置\npublic class BankFeignConfig {\n    @Bean\n    public Encoder bankRequestEncoder() {\n        return new BankMessageEncoder(); // 银行专用报文编码\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 银行模块调用实例\n```java\n// 在支付服务中调用银行模块\n@Service\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class PaymentServiceImpl implements PaymentService {\n    private final BankClient bankClient; // Feign注入\n    \n    public PaymentResult process(PaymentRequest request) {\n        // 1. 构建银行请求\n        BankRequest bankRequest = BankRequestBuilder.build(request);\n        \n        // 2. Feign调用（示例：CMB支付）\n        BankResponse response = bankClient.executePayment(bankRequest);\n        \n        // 3. 处理响应\n        if(response.isSuccess()){\n            return PaymentResult.success(response.getTransactionId());\n        } else {\n            throw new BankException(response.getErrorCode());\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n关键通信流程：\n1. 前端 → web模块（HTTP）\n2. web模块 → service模块（Spring Bean调用）\n3. service模块 → 银行系统（Feign+REST）\n4. service模块 → persistence模块（MyBatis）\n\n是否需要：\n1. 特定银行的协议细节？\n2. 事务传播示例？\n3. 异常处理完整链条？",
